## Goose operational notes (generated by agentteams)

This team's canonical brief is AGENTS.md (included above). Entry point:

    goose run --recipe .goose/recipes/orchestrator.yaml

Delegation model:
- The orchestrator recipe delegates to specialist recipes via `sub_recipes`
  (each runs in its own isolated session).
- Goose forbids nested delegation, so specialists reference cross-cutting
  agents in-context with the `summon` `load("<recipe-slug>")` tool rather
  than spawning a sub-agent. The relevant `load(...)` calls are listed in
  each specialist recipe under "Delegation & references (Goose)".
<!-- AGENTTEAMS:END goose_operational_notes -->

